{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1818.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"012db05eae545a2aa46e5c5320077bdd6fd0b0bd3ba74d49f52c55c0b94c697c","ja":"……画面が真っ暗なままですね？","zh":"……画面还是一片漆黑呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1818.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"19ddb6275d26defa8c4472baf8f08c4f1ba6ad6918ba6b5390423a64d371570e","ja":"あれっ！？　お、おかしいナ～……。","zh":"咦！？　这、这不对劲呀～……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1818.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b69c0c3fe103e1b62f6f2c112f9f5c8cc2d660cd55acb3c47b3b1f1764d82cc0","ja":"……あっ！　ろ、録画ボタン、\nちゃんと押せてなかったみたいっ……！","zh":"……啊！好、好像没按好录像按钮……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1818.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"bfc75a396fdc3e85cc0649f2358710f27683a691fefb0f2bb1aadf8fb8d83230","ja":"うう……ごめんネ、みんな。とってもステキな\nダンス動画が撮れたと思ったのに……。","zh":"呜呜……对不起啦，大家。我还以为拍到了特别棒的舞蹈视频……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1818.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"1180696c3c055e6603f3d9cbe1b7e85260920a94d3c44239921e50f1115dfc45","ja":"気にしなくていいよ！\nミスは誰にだってあるから！","zh":"不用在意！\n谁都会犯错的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1818.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"013138fea0ca165dd1d4caa7fbcc3f2ee5ab632a301a3d29a74788f98da33306","ja":"それに、撮れてなかったなら、\nもう一度撮ればいいんだよ！　でしょ？","zh":"而且，如果没拍到的话，再拍一次就好了！对吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1818.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"9fbb8126e6e82b8930b3d5dc42aca615dc3b039ca5da4239c8fca62f1866871d","ja":"そ、そうですね……。みんなで踊るの、\nとっても……た、楽しかったですし……。","zh":"是、是啊……大家一起跳舞，\n真的……特、特别开心……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1818.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"9ad6f8682ca9cc3bf16ae81898ec27a60329cd397ef6d6a97c01a57e88c0f3f2","ja":"ちょ、ちょっと恥ずかしいですけど……。\nもう1回くらい、大丈夫ですから。","zh":"虽、虽然有点害羞……不过已经大约1次了，没关系的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1818.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"18eea292a55a27955314f8fac4a37a3b0dfe62a4bfc688ee17a2a0c484694f86","ja":"私も、次はもっと高らかに\nホイッスルを響かせます。……やるぞ。","zh":"我下次也会让口哨声更加嘹亮地响起。……要上了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1818.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"3e04c29464b9c5aef8952b22ca45ff14d2d1fbd0323561da9c3c42c389d1afad","ja":"ミナコ、カレン、ミズキ……みんな、サンキューだヨ！\nみんなと一緒なら、動画は成功間違いなしだネ！","zh":"美奈子、可怜、瑞希……谢谢大家啦！\n只要和大家一起，视频肯定能成功！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1818.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"9a7522c8f638d8349ec794a85785e5de8255055cfb9bacd39e2c4b2a8a600b56","ja":"それに、さっきので感じがつかめたし、\n2回目の方がもっと、うまく踊れると思うな！","zh":"而且，通过刚才那次已经找到感觉了，我觉得第2次应该能跳得更好！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1818.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"a9ffc18952c1d4b8e34553ae0234a15ae580984e1922c863642e0be24693e9e5","ja":"はい。き、きっと私たちの気持ちが\nみなさんにも、伝わると思います……。","zh":"是的。我、我相信我们的心意一定也能传达给大家……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1818.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"f6d70522a645cd2439fea4f075ee4016808ae6b5e790776e30f65e9327093e1b","ja":"エヘヘっ♪　ワタシも、\nなんだか、さっきよりずっと楽しくなってきたヨ～♪","zh":"嘿嘿♪ 我也不知怎么的，比刚才开心多了哟～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1818.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"27bd0b5a9a00f4f840efc260ca39cb54fe8fc9f8981cc80b5fcb807c476e15b5","ja":"私も、もっとテンションが上がってきました。\n……やるぞ。","zh":"我也越来越兴奋了。\n……干吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1818.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"2491a4ca8d10fda8f656f13061c82c121c69fc64dc722785b8fbcb132e172499","ja":"うん！　みんながどんなリアクションしてくれるか、\n今から楽しみだナ！","zh":"嗯！真期待大家会作出什么样的反应，已经等不及了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1818.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"8daa446a9da6ab4cdcde374960f6bf037bd13c9a350ddc6e998fb575a69d9b4d","ja":"それじゃあ、もう一度……スタートだヨ！","zh":"那么，再来一次……开始啦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
